codex
The claim needs correction: stores return a status that `swpctx` discards; loads return only data and discard the status inside the helper. Neither passes `NO_EXCEPTIONS`. The fork’s Alpha translator returns failure without raising a guest fault, so I’m checking how the shared memory layer handles that return and whether unbacked memory behaves differently.

