codex
There’s another distinction: a failed translation returns failure and zero-fills a read, but an address outside physical RAM can drop writes and return zeroes while reporting success. I also found checked store-helper results in the debugger and checked `memory_rw` results in Alpha’s ordinary load/store path; no comparable PAL context-switch check turned up.

